        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "Nh\u1EADt k\u00FD quan s\u00E1t h\u1EA1t gi\u1ED1ng v\u00E0 h\u1ECDc c\u00E1ch ki\u00EAn nh\u1EABn.",
        "IsPublished": true
